// The clearing's scenery, the same every run: each `scatter` walks one or more edges of the arena and drops a model in
// slots `step` u apart. Distances are u; `out` is how far past the edge a slot sits (negative is inside), `spread` adds
// up to that much more at random; `jitter` slides a slot along the edge; `scale` +- `vary`/2 sizes it; `chance` is the
// odds a slot is filled; `face="in"` turns the model's front (+X) towards the centre, otherwise it faces anywhere.
// `extend` runs the row that far past the edge's ends. `along="field"` instead lays a `step` grid over the whole clearing
// (`extend` past its edges). `paint` is the palette token it wears. Models are scenery in models/.

// Dead trees: a ragged row well past each edge (up close they'd crowd the fight), two leaning in at the near corners.
scatter "far-trees" model="tree" paint="--wood" along="top" out=4.5 spread=4 step=4.2 jitter=2.5 extend=8 scale=2.1 vary=0.8 seed=11
scatter "side-trees" model="tree" paint="--wood" along="sides" out=4 spread=3 step=4.5 jitter=2.5 extend=3 scale=2.1 vary=0.8 seed=12
scatter "corner-trees" model="tree" paint="--wood" along="bottom" out=4.5 step=34 scale=2.2 seed=13

// The edge itself: a broken line of graves facing into the clearing, and roots between them.
scatter "graves" model="grave" paint="--stone" along="all" out=0.9 spread=0.8 step=2.4 jitter=1 scale=0.9 vary=0.35 chance=0.5 face="in" seed=21
scatter "roots" model="roots" paint="--wood" along="all" out=0.8 spread=1 step=3.1 jitter=1.4 scale=1.2 vary=0.7 chance=0.4 seed=22

// The floor of the clearing: stones, dead grass, and the bones of the ones who came before.
scatter "stones" model="rocks" paint="--wood" along="field" step=4 jitter=3.5 extend=4 scale=0.6 vary=0.5 chance=0.4 seed=31
scatter "grass" model="grass" paint="--moss" along="field" step=2.2 jitter=2.2 extend=5 scale=0.9 vary=0.6 chance=0.6 seed=32
scatter "bones" model="bones" paint="--bone" along="field" step=5.5 jitter=4 extend=1 scale=0.8 vary=0.3 chance=0.45 seed=33
